Fresh Bing official-benchmark RSS,Google exact model/pricing query returning an interstitial,and DuckDuckGo benchmark/context query a202 challenge. Yahoo follow-up500. Direct correct dedicated Alibaba English/Chinese pages and actual gateway resolved identity/specifications;an initial generic qwen-flash page was recognized as a different2025 model. BenchLM's Epoch citation led to official benchmark methodology/data page and downloadable raw CSVs,which were inspected for exact unsuffixed/none runs. No peer,Plus/Max or3.8 scores substituted.

